Changes in this port
  - Translated from TypeScript to Rust; the raster decoder, its base85 envelope and
    the one_bit encoder used for the canonical check are ported. The stream parser,
    object-prompt builder, COCO run-length and SVG conversions are not.
  - Typed inputs: widths and heights are u32, and the caller passes the largest raster
    area it accepts, checked before any allocation.
  - Errors are a Rust error type carrying Meta's messages.

